    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humanity is doomed and you've crash-landed in The Crack of the Moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1950s, humanity seeded life in a deep lunar crater known as <i>The Crack</i>; a warped pocket of low gravity and overgrown experiments left to evolve on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Earth is dying. And for some reason\u2026 you\u2019re the one sent to find out how life still thrives on the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve crash-landed. Your suit\u2019s gone. You\u2019re all jiggly now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tools. No rockets. Just your ability to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold, aim your arc, and release with precision. This is a casual take on the precision platformer genre, a relaxing rage game where one bad jump can send you tumbling, but generous checkpoints keep you climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off mid-air saves and discover wild shortcuts. It\u2019s skill-based, satisfying, and just the right kind of absurd.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing Rage Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/beb1aaaab90347efe42cd2f8e50ec7dc.poster.avif?t=1752216395\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/beb1aaaab90347efe42cd2f8e50ec7dc.webm?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/beb1aaaab90347efe42cd2f8e50ec7dc.mp4?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaphopper is for people who love a challenge,\u00a0but also need a breather.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Focus. Jump. Relax.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/2b17e48724a037e2f053bb490cb965f7.poster.avif?t=1752216395\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/2b17e48724a037e2f053bb490cb965f7.webm?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/2b17e48724a037e2f053bb490cb965f7.mp4?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your jumps with a simple yet satisfying\u00a0hold-and-aim\u00a0mechanic. Make your way up strange landscapes, leap by leap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision jumping</strong> with simple, intuitive hold-aim-release controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints</strong> to reduce frustration after long falls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision-level design</strong> that rewards both experimentation and mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No stressful time limits </strong>so you can take you time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's it for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who like a challenge but also appreciate a moment to unwind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who enjoy platformers with tight controls and predictable physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone looking for a satisfying challenge where jumping mastery is key</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humanity is doomed and you've crash-landed in The Crack of the Moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1950s, humanity seeded life in a deep lunar crater known as <i>The Crack</i>; a warped pocket of low gravity and overgrown experiments left to evolve on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Earth is dying. And for some reason\u2026 you\u2019re the one sent to find out how life still thrives on the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve crash-landed. Your suit\u2019s gone. You\u2019re all jiggly now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tools. No rockets. Just your ability to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold, aim your arc, and release with precision. This is a casual take on the precision platformer genre, a relaxing rage game where one bad jump can send you tumbling, but generous checkpoints keep you climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off mid-air saves and discover wild shortcuts. It\u2019s skill-based, satisfying, and just the right kind of absurd.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing Rage Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/beb1aaaab90347efe42cd2f8e50ec7dc.poster.avif?t=1752216395\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/beb1aaaab90347efe42cd2f8e50ec7dc.webm?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/beb1aaaab90347efe42cd2f8e50ec7dc.mp4?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaphopper is for people who love a challenge,\u00a0but also need a breather.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Focus. Jump. Relax.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/2b17e48724a037e2f053bb490cb965f7.poster.avif?t=1752216395\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/2b17e48724a037e2f053bb490cb965f7.webm?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838080/extras/2b17e48724a037e2f053bb490cb965f7.mp4?t=1752216395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your jumps with a simple yet satisfying\u00a0hold-and-aim\u00a0mechanic. Make your way up strange landscapes, leap by leap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision jumping</strong> with simple, intuitive hold-aim-release controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoints</strong> to reduce frustration after long falls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision-level design</strong> that rewards both experimentation and mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No stressful time limits </strong>so you can take you time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who's it for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who like a challenge but also appreciate a moment to unwind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who enjoy platformers with tight controls and predictable physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone looking for a satisfying challenge where jumping mastery is key</p></li></ul>",
